{"data": {"sources": [{"quote": "培训合同相关的付款、发票与档案管理按公司财务与档案制度执行。本办法自发布之日起施行，由法务部与人力资源部共同解释。", "chunkId": "1ec98b03-f558-4555-a3db-431add80fb14", "heading": "第六章 附则", "filename": "D4-培训服务合同管理办法.md", "documentId": "9094281a-34b7-44dd-856b-15264d543c53", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.6730134453105433, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 6, "charFrom": 882, "filename": "D4-培训服务合同管理办法.md", "projectId": "6ea26190-7e34-4e71-b12e-353035a238e3", "documentId": "9094281a-34b7-44dd-856b-15264d543c53", "charThrough": 939, "offsetCoordinate": "CLEANED_TEXT_UTF16_V2", "embeddingGeneration": "1282f14c-5e54-4180-828c-b977d62a41ef"}}, {"quote": "申请材料包括：交接清单电子件、双方单位负责人意见、涉及系统权限的权限矩阵、涉及外部供应商的原合同关键条款摘录。材料不全的，系统一次性列出全部缺项，不接受分批补正。", "chunkId": "c167b01b-6bc1-4f36-bf9f-b14cea90c24d", "heading": "三、材料要求", "filename": "B1-服务交接申请条件.md", "documentId": "16bac300-5d63-4c3c-b7d2-f9acec30a880", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.4245477886625364, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 3, "charFrom": 482, "filename": "B1-服务交接申请条件.md", "projectId": "6ea26190-7e34-4e71-b12e-353035a238e3", "documentId": "16bac300-5d63-4c3c-b7d2-f9acec30a880", "charThrough": 563, "offsetCoordinate": "CLEANED_TEXT_UTF16_V2", "embeddingGeneration": "1282f14c-5e54-4180-828c-b977d62a41ef"}}, {"quote": "针对《差旅费管理办法（V2.0）》执行中的集中反馈，经公司审批同意，现将有关事项补充通知如下：", "chunkId": "c8ff9374-dd8b-4211-8dda-86ed0756cb55", "heading": "各部门、各中心：", "filename": "D3-差旅费管理补充通知.md", "documentId": "7a60792a-fb41-4011-a2b4-835bdfa96180", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.4220495092573737, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 1, "charFrom": 94, "filename": "D3-差旅费管理补充通知.md", "projectId": "6ea26190-7e34-4e71-b12e-353035a238e3", "documentId": "7a60792a-fb41-4011-a2b4-835bdfa96180", "charThrough": 141, "offsetCoordinate": "CLEANED_TEXT_UTF16_V2", "embeddingGeneration": "1282f14c-5e54-4180-828c-b977d62a41ef"}}, {"quote": "审批通过后流程自动进入执行阶段，交接双方按清单逐项执行。流程状态对双方单位公开，涉及客户敏感信息的字段仅对相关角色可见。", "chunkId": "46252dd4-4f3c-407a-8502-93ae9b031fb1", "heading": "五、生效与公开", "filename": "B2-服务交接审批流程.md", "documentId": "f2586791-ced8-4357-b16f-bd60f8dcb069", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.4080175192293717, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 5, "charFrom": 750, "filename": "B2-服务交接审批流程.md", "projectId": "6ea26190-7e34-4e71-b12e-353035a238e3", "documentId": "f2586791-ced8-4357-b16f-bd60f8dcb069", "charThrough": 810, "offsetCoordinate": "CLEANED_TEXT_UTF16_V2", "embeddingGeneration": "1282f14c-5e54-4180-828c-b977d62a41ef"}}, {"quote": "乘坐交通工具的等级按职级执行：公司负责人可乘飞机公务舱；部门负责人及以下乘飞机经济舱、高铁一等座；其他人员乘高铁二等座及以下。因紧急公务确需超标准乘坐的，事前经分管负责人同意。

